@startuml
title シーケンス図: 練習モードの一問解答処理

actor ユーザー as User
participant "画面 (UI)" as UI
participant "PracticeService" as Service
participant "QuestionDAO" as QDAO
participant "LearningHistoryDAO" as HDAO
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: 練習開始を要求
UI -> Service: getNextQuestion()
Service -> QDAO: fetchNextPracticeQuestion()
QDAO -> DB: SELECT (誤答優先 2 -> 未回答 0 / 1)
DB --> QDAO: 設問データ取得
QDAO --> Service: Questionオブジェクト
Service --> UI: 設問・選択肢表示

User -> UI: 回答(例: 'A')を選択して送信
UI -> Service: answerQuestion(questionId, 'A', timeSec)
Service -> Service: 正誤判定 (correctAnswer == 'A')

Service -> HDAO: saveHistory(LearningHistory)
HDAO -> DB: INSERT INTO learning_history
DB --> HDAO: OK

Service -> HDAO: 優先度ステータス更新
HDAO -> DB: UPDATE (正解時: 優先度下げ / 誤答時: 優先度 2 維持)
DB --> HDAO: OK

Service --> UI: 判定結果 (TRUE/FALSE) & 解説データ
UI --> User: 結果画面表示（正誤・解説）
@enduml